">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.579" end="00:53.307"><span begin="00:48.579" end="00:48.779">I'm </span><span begin="00:48.779" end="00:49.043">heading </span><span begin="00:49.043" end="00:49.347">back </span><span begin="00:49.347" end="00:50.931">inside </span><span begin="00:51.091" end="00:51.387">sitting </span><span begin="00:51.387" end="00:51.675">alone </span><span begin="00:51.675" end="00:51.923">with </span><span begin="00:51.923" end="00:52.683">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.307" end="00:59.714"><span begin="00:53.307" end="00:53.467">I </span><span begin="00:53.467" end="00:53.627">think </span><span begin="00:53.627" end="00:53.811">I </span><span begin="00:53.811" end="00:54.115">know </span><span begin="00:54.115" end="00:54.739">what's </span><span begin="00:54.739" end="00:55.538">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.714" end="01:03.479"><span begin="00:59.714" end="00:59.906">My </span><span begin="00:59.906" end="01:00.719">friends </span><span begin="01:00.863" end="01:01.007">put </span><span begin="01:01.007" end="01:01.151">on </span><span begin="01:01.151" end="01:01.303">their </span><span begin="01:01.303" end="01:01.663">bravest </span><span begin="01:01.663" end="01:02.511">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.479" end="01:08.064"><span begin="01:03.479" end="01:03.679">The </span><span begin="01:03.679" end="01:03.975">tales </span><span begin="01:03.975" end="01:04.479">between </span><span begin="01:04.479" end="01:04.735">their </span><span begin="01:04.735" end="01:05.639">legs </span><span begin="01:05.791" end="01:05.943">is </span><span begin="01:05.943" end="01:06.095">only </span><span begin="01:06.095" end="01:06.392">out </span><span begin="01:06.392" end="01:06.575">of </span><span begin="01:06.575" end="01:07.671">place</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.064" end="01:10.622"><span begin="01:08.064" end="01:08.239">I </span><span begin="01:08.239" end="01:08.391">be